1115-5. The generator must split its current single version constant: `protocolVersion = "1.0.0-rc.4"` drives the manifest/current v2 case, while a separate immutable `conformanceClaimV1ProtocolVersion = "1.0.0-rc.3"` drives regeneration of the historical v1 cases. Reusing the rc.4 constant for claim v1 would silently undo the compatibility decision.
